      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "I took a trip recently to the Eld'uukhar inhabited planet in the system Magna Ilo to trade for a few crystals. The cities of this planet were just as opulent as I had heard, buildings crafted from crystal and gold, towering spires that touched the sky. Their temples were a sight to behold. I did not venture inside out of respect for the worshippers"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "私は最近、システムMagna Iloでエルドゥウハル居住惑星に旅行して、いくつかの結晶を交換しました。 この惑星の都市は、私が聞いたのと同じように豊かでした。水晶と金から作られた建物、空に触れるそびえ立つ尖塔。 彼らのお寺は見るに足らない光景だった。 崇拝者への敬意から、私は中に入ってはいませんでした"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "but I'd imagine the inside to be just as beautiful. Despite the wonders I have seen there, I have left that planet with a feeling of unease. I had taken a wrong turn and found myself in a sector that seemed to be abandoned. The temples that I had seen were here also, but as piles of dirty rubble, and banners embroidered with a symbol I had not seen before were laid torn and ruined on the ground."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "内部も同じように美しいと思います そこで見た不思議にもかかわらず、私はその惑星を不安な気持ちで去りました。 私は間違った方向へ進み、見捨てられているように思える分野に身を置いた。 私が見たお寺もここにありましたが、汚れた瓦の山として、今まで見たこともないシンボルで刺繍された旗が地面に破れ、破滅させられました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "I came to what could only be described as a slum. Male Eld'uukhar dressed in rags were huddled by clusters of Thanatite crystal to keep warm, horribly thin from a lack of food. Haunted, I left that place quickly, and the planet soon after. I doubt I'll be making another trip."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "私はスラムとしか言いようがないものにたどり着いた。 敷物を着た男性エルドゥウハールは、食物不足から暖かく、恐ろしく薄く保つために、サナタイトの結晶の束に集まっていた。 お化けをし、私はすぐにその場所を去り、すぐに惑星を去りました。 私はまた旅行に行くとは思えない。"
